ather system and a vibrant cast of characters to meet, “Nivalis Nights” offers a unique simulation where your path is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488490/extras/a60af828fbf6fae4e201e7edde452fc9.poster.avif?t=1786355242\" width=620 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488490/extras/a60af828fbf6fae4e201e7edde452fc9.webm?t=1786355242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488490/extras/a60af828fbf6fae4e201e7edde452fc9.mp4?t=1786355242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tChoose how you spend each day in this cyberpunk slice of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tManage businesses like restaurants, ramen bars or night clubs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tBuy or grow your own ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tExplore the city with your own boat and go fishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tDecorate your home(s) or customize others for friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tDiscover the stories of the people you meet in the city and manage your relationships with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tChallenge NPC’s for mini games and take part in a chess tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tAvoid security systems during curfew and commit sabotage to your competitors. But beware! What happens to them, can happen to you as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1488490/extras/559ccaf0e91cc7ec75808a70878a3ea5.poster.avif?t=1786355242\" width=620 height=184 ><source src=\"https: